While we're at it, here's a simple script to show the av. stats of
each of the character classes in the score file, not counting the
quits (change '/u/nh/record' accordingly):

cat /u/nh/record | awk '
!/*quit*/ { c=substr($9,1,1) ; sum[c] += $8+0 ; num[c]++ }
END { for (c in num) { printf "     %c %3d %6.0f\n",c,num[c],sum[c]/num[c] } }
' | sort -nr +2

